   Summarize the content of the following text:
'In a move that surprised many, Google announced that it would discontinue the popular Google Reader product. After 10 years, Google is pulling the plug on Google Reader, the service that millions of people used to read RSS feeds.  Google hasn't provided much in the way of explanation, but TechCrunch reported this morning that the company will close Reader at the end of the month, and the product will cease to function on July 1.
